"}]},{"text":"கடியா","tr":"kaṭiyā","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கடி","tr":"kaṭi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"}]},{"text":"தோளே","tr":"tōḷē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தோ","tr":"tō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளே","tr":"ḷē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"அம்ம","parts":[{"text":"அம்ம","lemma":"அம்ம","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழி","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோழி","parts":[{"text":"தோழி","lemma":"தோழி","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அன்னைக்","parts":[{"text":"அன்னைக்","lemma":"அன்னைக்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"குயர்நிலை","parts":[{"text":"குயர்நிலை","lemma":"குயர்நிலை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உலகமுஞ்","parts":[{"text":"உலகமுஞ்","lemma":"உலகமுஞ்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"சிறிதால்","parts":[{"text":"சிறிதால்","lemma":"சிறிதால்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அவர்மலை","parts":[{"text":"அவர்மலை","lemma":"அவர்மலை","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"},{"surface":"பெய்த","parts":[{"text":"பெய்த","lemma":"பெய்","gloss":"that rained"}],"gloss":"that rained"},{"surface":"மணங்கமழ்","parts":[{"text":"மணம்","lemma":"மணம்","gloss":"fragrance"},{"text":"கமழ்","lemma":"கமழ்","gloss":"emitting"}],"gloss":"emitting fragrance"},{"surface":"உந்தியொடு","parts":[{"text":"உந்தி","lemma":"உந்தி","gloss":"freshet"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with the freshet"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"morning"}],"gloss":"morning"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வா","gloss":"that came"}],"gloss":"that came"},{"surface":"காந்தள்","parts":[{"text":"காந்தள்","lemma":"காந்தள்","gloss":"Malabar glory lily"}],"gloss":"Malabar glory lily"},{"surface":"முழுமுதல்","parts":[{"text":"முழு","lemma":"முழு","gloss":"entire"},{"text":"முதல்","lemma":"முதல்","gloss":"root"}],"gloss":"entire root"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"மெல்லிலை","parts":[{"text":"மெல்","lemma":"மெல்","gloss":"soft"},{"text":"இலை","lemma":"இலை","gloss":"leaf"}],"gloss":"soft leaf"},{"surface":"குழைய","parts":[{"text":"குழைய","lemma":"குழை","gloss":"to droop"}],"gloss":"to droop"},{"surface":"முயங்கலும்","parts":[{"text":"முயங்கல்","lemma":"முயங்கல்","gloss":"embracing"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and embracing"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இல்லுய்த்து","parts":[{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"house"},{"text":"உய்த்து","lemma":"உய்","gloss":"bringing"}],"gloss":"bringing to the house"},{"surface":"நடுதலும்","parts":[{"text":"நடுதல்","lemma":"நடுதல்","gloss":"planting"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"and"}],"gloss":"and planting"},{"surface":"கடியாதோளே","parts":[{"text":"கடியாதோள்","lemma":"கடியாதோள்","gloss":"she who did not forbid"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed she did not forbid"}]}],"literal":"Listen, may you live, friend! To mother, / the high-status world also is small indeed. His mountain's / evening-rained, fragrance-emitting freshet-with, / morning-came, Malabar glory lily's entire root, / so that its soft leaves droop, embracing, and / bringing to the house and planting, indeed she did not forbid.","translation":"Listen, my friend, may you live long! Even the high heavenly world is too small for mother's heart. For when I embraced the entire root of the Malabar glory lily—which came in the morning with the fragrant freshet of the evening rains on his mountain—so closely that its soft leaves drooped, and then brought it home and planted it, she did not forbid me at all.","modern":"தோழியே, கேள்! நீ வாழ்க! அன்னைக்கு மேலுலகமும் மிகச் சிறியதே ஆகும். தலைவனுடைய மலையில் மாலையில் பெய்த மழையினால் உண்டான நறுமணம் வீசும் வெள்ளத்தோடு அடித்துக்கொண்டு வந்து, காலையில் கரை சேர்ந்த செங்காந்தள் செடியின் முழு வேரையும், அதன் மென்மையான இலைகள் குழைந்துபோகும்படி நான் தழுவிக்கொண்டதையும், அதை வீட்டிற்கு எடுத்துவந்து நட்டதையும் அன்னை தடுக்கவே இல்லை.","explanation":"The heroine is speaking to her friend in a kurinji (mountainous) landscape, expressing her joy at her mother's tacit approval of her love. The hero's mountain is described as having evening rains that wash down a beautiful glory lily in the morning freshet. The heroine embraced this lily so passionately that its soft leaves drooped, and then she brought it home to plant in their garden. Her mother, witnessing this, did not object or punish her, which the heroine interprets as a sign that her mother understands and accepts her love for the hero of that mountain. The key words are 'அன்னைக்கு' (to mother), 'முயங்கலும்' (embracing), and 'கடியாதோளே' (she did not forbid).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}